			"notes": "# Changelog v1.1.0\n\n### New Features\n* **Clan Help System:** Implemented the new /clan help command for easier plugin navigation.\n* **Officer Role:** Added \"Officers\" (aka moderators) for delegated clan management.\n* **Clan Access & Joining:** Implemented /clan set access for privacy management.\n    * Added /clan join with synced join messages and notifications for online members.\n* **Leader Commands:** Added /clan set name.\n    * Added /clan set color (now supporting hex prefixes like #D0D0D0 and a \"reset\" option).\n* **Admin Tools:** Added /clan admin rename.\n    * Implemented specific permission nodes for all /clan admin commands.\n* **Improved Lookups:** Added player name lookup functionality to the /clan info command.\n\n### Improvements & Refinements\n* **Tab Completion:** Switched to canonical names for clan tab completion to improve usability.\n* **User Feedback:** Added missing feedback messages and updated usage strings for admin commands.\n* **Documentation:** Extensive updates to README.md and internal documentation.\n* **CI/CD:** Integrated GitHub Actions to create dev-build artifacts automatically.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n* **Tab Completion Fix:** Resolved a bug where /clan join suggestions incorrectly displayed all clans instead of only those with open joins allowed.\n* **Visual Tweaks:** Updated the default colored placeholder to gray and renamed \"Status\" to \"Access\" in clan info messages.\n* **Permission Logic:** Adjusted permission checks for /clan modify to be more user-friendly. (this is now the /clan set command)"
		},
